    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonAccessRestrictedOrUnavailable">目前帳號可能沒有存取權限，或者影片已經不可見。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonVideoUnavailable">影片已失效、不可見或無法取得稿件資料。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonNoPlaybackResource">沒有找到可下載的影片或音訊資源。</system:String>
