    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonRequestTimedOut">取得影片資料或播放資源時逾時。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonInvalidResponse">B 站傳回的影片資料無法辨識或不完整。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonApiRejected">B 站拒絕了這部影片的請求。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonNoDownloadData">沒有取得足夠資料來建立下載任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadUnavailableReasonUnknown">無法確定失敗原因。詳細資訊已寫入日誌。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadContentConflictMessage">“{0}”無法完全符合原下載設定。請接受實際可取得的內容和品質，或跳過這一頁。</system:String>
